Third-party components
======================

Note: ksud is not bundled. The App executes the ksud payload
(manager APK's lib/arm64/libksud.so or the randomized equivalent) in place.
The manager APK itself is installed by the user.


1. CVE-2026-64560 public tooling
   Source: https://github.com/Feng1586/CVE-2026-64560-public
   License: Apache-2.0
   Used: historical source/flow reference only. The 64560 chain and its
         binaries are no longer packed or deployed by the App.

2. KernelSU
   Source: https://github.com/tiann/KernelSU
   License: GPL-2.0
   Used: LKM source at build time; ksud and manager are distributed by upstream.

3. KernelSU Next
   Source: https://github.com/rifsxd/KernelSU-Next
   License: GPL-2.0
   Used: LKM source at build time; ksud / manager are upstream artifacts.

